\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1.1}{\ignorespaces Summary of the CSC electronics boards that will be upgraded during LS2 and LS3. Boards above the horizontal line are placed on-chamber, while those below the line occur in off-chamber crates. Of the 540 new DCFEBv2s, 504 will be installed in the ME1/1 chambers, while the rest plus the DCFEBs currently in ME1/1 will be installed in ME2/1. The ALCTs in stations 2, 3, and 4 will be upgraded during LS2 while those in station 1 will be upgraded in LS3. The ALCTs in ME1/3 do not need upgrading because they will be replaced with the ALCT-S6 currently installed in ME1/1. \relax }}{8}{table.caption.21}
